<!-- 4. About Us Section -->
<section class="section-padding about-section" id="about">
  <div class="container-custom about-container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>About Zevi Promotion</h2>
      <p>Looking for the perfect promotional item or searching for fresh inspiration? Zevi Promotion is your ultimate one-stop destination for custom promotional products and corporate gifts, proudly serving clients worldwide.</p>
      <p>Our process is simple, fast, and built around you. Zevi Promotion transforms your vision into impactful marketing solutions. Our design experts will prepare and format your artwork using industry-standard software such as Adobe Illustrator, CorelDRAW, and Photoshop, ensuring compatibility with all major production processes. We support popular file formats including AI, CDR, EPS, PDF, and PNG. We combine an extensive product inventory with premium branding and decoration techniques, all while prioritizing sustainable practices.</p>
      <p style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px;">Elevate your brand, make a lasting impression, and stand out from the competition with Zevi Promotion!</p>
